@startuml terminal-state
title Terminal Session Lifecycle (tmux-backed)
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
  FontColor #222222
}

[*] --> Idle
Idle : No tmux session\nfor this instance

Idle --> Connected : first device connects\ncreatePTY(id)\ntmux new-session -s main
state Connected {
  [*] --> Active
  Active : one device attached
  Active --> MultiClient : second device connects\ntmux attach -t main
  MultiClient : two devices attached\nboth see same output
  MultiClient --> Active : one disconnects
}

Connected --> Detached : all devices disconnect\n(Ctrl-b d after 200ms)
Detached : tmux session persists\nno clients attached
Detached --> Connected : reconnect\ntmux attach -t main\n(full scrollback restored)

Connected --> Idle : container stopped\nor instance terminated
Detached --> Idle : container stopped
@enduml
